---
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../config';
import LegalPage from '../components/legal/LegalPage.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, REFUND_DAYS, TRIAL_DAYS } from '../components/legal/legal';
---
<LegalPage
  title={`Refunds · ${PRODUCT_NAME}`}
  heading="Refund policy"
  description={`A ${REFUND_DAYS}-day money-back guarantee on every ${PRODUCT_NAME} licence, on top of the ${TRIAL_DAYS}-day free trial. No questions asked.`}
  ogTheme="dark"
>
  <div class="legal-card">
    <h2>{REFUND_DAYS}-day money-back guarantee</h2>
    <p>
      Try {PRODUCT_NAME} free for {TRIAL_DAYS} days before you buy. If you buy and then change your mind, ask for a full refund within <strong>{REFUND_DAYS} days of purchase</strong>. You don't need to give a reason.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="how">How to ask for a refund</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=Refund`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address you bought with, or include your order number or the email on your receipt.</li>
    <li>We reply within 2 business days and issue the refund through Polar, our merchant of record.</li>
    <li>The full amount you paid, including any tax, goes back to the original payment method. Your bank usually shows it within 5–10 business days.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="after">What happens to your licence</h2>
  <p>
    When the refund is issued, your licence key is deactivated on all your Macs. {PRODUCT_NAME} goes back to read-only mode: you can still open and
    browse your repositories, and nothing in them is changed or deleted.
  </p>

  <h2 id="later">After {REFUND_DAYS} days</h2>
  <p>
    After {REFUND_DAYS} days refunds are at our discretion, but email us anyway. If you were charged twice, bought by mistake, or {PRODUCT_NAME} doesn't
    work on your Mac and we can't fix it, we'll sort it out. Polar may also issue a refund on its own within 60 days of purchase to prevent
    a chargeback.
  </p>

  <h2 id="law">Your legal rights</h2>
  <p>
    This guarantee adds to your rights under consumer law; it doesn't replace them. EU and UK buyers: the statutory right of withdrawal for
    digital content can end once you activate your licence, but this {REFUND_DAYS}-day guarantee still applies.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please contact us before opening a dispute with your bank. A refund is faster for you, and a chargeback costs a small independent developer
    a fee on top of the refund.
  </p>
  <p>See also the <a href="/terms">terms of sale</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
